# Home tool sketches

When adding or replacing pictures on the home tool cards, follow [`.cursor/skills/home-tool-sketches/SKILL.md`](../skills/home-tool-sketches/SKILL.md).

- Same chibi girl, pencil on cream paper, monochrome.
- **New composition every time** (camera, pose, scale). Do not reuse the kneeling-over-a-book pose as a card.
- Files: `web/home/sketches/sketch-{id}.webp` (800px WebP).
- Pass the skill's `style-reference.webp` into image generation.
- After shipping a sketch, add its composition to the table in the skill.
